<title>SRI LANKA: Vanik up on buying by retail investors.</title>
<headline>Vanik up on buying by retail investors.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Vanik Incorporation Ltd rose 3.51 percent or 50 cents to 14.75 rupees in early Monday trade, as small investors reacted to last week's election results, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors who were waiting to see how the government would fare, are now buying after they saw the result,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The ruling coalition won a sweeping win in Friday's local government election, leaving investors in no doubt about its popularity, he said.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
